From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 15:57:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] WinSystemAmlogicGLESContext: probe the kernel at a same-mode
 switch

A new stream HDR type at an unchanged mode forces a CRTC re-enable,
an UPDATE write and a link drop even when only the HDR packets change.
A DV title after a dv2sdr title keeps the HDR type and gets no
re-enable for its new colour attrs. The probe needs the meson_hdmi
connector check that flags a same-mode attr change.
